    "Tabs, player tinting, visualizers and the notch mirror.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pestañas, color del reproductor, visualizadores y el espejo del notch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签页、播放器着色、可视化效果与刘海镜子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background color follows the weather and time of day; the animated background accounts for most of this feature's battery use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El color de fondo cambia con el tiempo y la hora del día; el fondo animado supone casi todo el consumo de esta función."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景颜色随天气和昼夜变化；动画背景约占本功能的主要耗电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The battery indicator in the notch, plus status alerts when power is connected or disconnected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El indicador de batería en el notch y los avisos de estado al conectar o desconectar la corriente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海里的电池指示器，以及插拔电源时的状态提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The calendar and reminders in the notch: what to show and what to hide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El calendario y los recordatorios en el notch: qué mostrar y qué ocultar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海里的日历与提醒事项：显示哪些、隐藏哪些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The previously selected folder is missing. Please choose it again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se encuentra la carpeta elegida anteriormente. Vuelve a elegirla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到之前选的文件夹，请重新选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The weather card in the notch: how it locates you, display options and current data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tarjeta del tiempo en el notch: cómo te localiza, opciones de visualización y datos actuales."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海里的天气卡片：定位方式、显示选项与当前数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The weather service is temporarily unavailable": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servicio meteorológico no está disponible temporalmente"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "天气服务暂时不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no calendars in the system Calendar app yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay calendarios en la app Calendario del sistema."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统「日历」里还没有任何日历。"
